{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And he brought him wine.</b> From where did he have wine? We do not find that his mother gave him wine. Rather, Michael brought him wine from the Garden of Eden. And you do not find [an instance] of good and blessing except this one and that of Abraham, as it is said: ״ומלכי צדק מלך שלם הוציא לחם ויין״. This one too, once he drank, he blessed him."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:06:08.459899934Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}